        "result": "<task id=\"ses_f4cf85ecfffe0THtJoaKQPQEZs\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\nI now have a complete picture. Here is the detailed structured report.\n\n---\n\n# A2E internal app scaffolding — research report\n\nAll paths below are absolute. I did not modify anything.\n\nTwo reference apps exist under `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-apps/internal/`:\n\n| App | Package name | App UUID | UUID namespace |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `a2e-documents` | `a2e-documents` | `19126a9c-7cc0-4368-aaba-c7e5a87b0c48` | `c31a*` |\n| `a2e-projects` | `a2e-projects` | `4f759655-84f8-434d-9c76-ee1850e8c1a4` | `c31b*` |\n| `a2e-accounting` (Bilan) | `a2e-accounting` | `b11a0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001` | `b11a*` |\n| `a2e-chat` (planned) | — | not created | not assigned |\n\n`docs/plan/03-integration-blueprint.md` (lines 56-61) explicitly names `a2e-chat` as a planned app, and `docs/applications.md` (lines 29-35) lists current state. There is **no existing `a2e-chat`** in the tree.\n\nThe authoring guide is `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-apps/README-A2E.md` and the anatomy standard is `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/docs/plan/04-twenty-native-law.md` §2.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Full file trees (excluding `node_modules`, and excluding generated `.twenty/output` bodies)\n\n### `packages/twenty-apps/internal/a2e-documents/`\n\n```\na2e-documents/\n├── .gitignore\n├── .nvmrc\n├── .oxlintrc.json\n├── .yarnrc.yml\n├── package.json\n├── tsconfig.json\n├── yarn.lock\n├── .twenty/output/                      # generated by `twenty dev:build`, gitignored\n│   ├── manifest.json\n│   ├── package.json\n│   ├── yarn.lock\n│   └── src/\n│       ├── front-components/*.tsx|.mjs|.map\n│       └── logic-functions/*.ts|.mjs|.map\n└── src/\n    ├── application.config.ts\n    ├── command-menu-items/\n    │   ├── create-document-and-open.command-menu-item.ts\n    │   ├── create-document.command-menu-item.ts\n    │   ├── go-to-documents.command-menu-ite